What is the order of execution?

console.log(1);
setTimeout(() => console.log(2), 0);
Promise.resolve().then(() => console.log(3));
console.log(4);

What is logged?

async function f() { return 1; }
f().then(v => console.log(v));

What is logged?

try { await Promise.reject(new Error('boom')); } catch (e) { console.log(e.message); }

(assume top-level await is allowed)
